<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83350" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττάκιον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tablet for writing on, label, ticket</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				633.19
			</span></i> sq.), <i><span class="en">
				Dinol.
				7
			</span></i>; <i>written message</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράψας
				βραχὺ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				31.13.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.830.18
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Puteoli</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				136.36
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc.; <i>ticket, pass</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				674.21
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); <i>receipt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PStrassb.
				44.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <i>votive tablet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3442
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Philadelphia</span>); <i>promissory
			note</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1155.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, etc.; <i>account-book,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				297.4
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGoodsp.Cair.</u>
				30 iv 5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>list</i> of members of an association, hence of the association
			itself, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				112
			</span></i>
			<u>Intr.</u>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιττακιάρχης</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Lat. <i>pittacium, strip of leather</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				3.10
			</span></i>.</div>
